-- Master product price list ported from the standalone chemical-inventory app.
-- Source: splash-inventory/supabase/seed.sql (products only).
--
-- Products are NOT location-scoped, so they port 1:1 into inventory.products --
-- columns match exactly (id, name, price_per_ml, unit_type, description). The
-- rest of that seed is keyed to the dropped uuid `locations` table and is NOT
-- portable without a location_code mapping; do not run it.
--
-- Idempotent: re-running is a no-op (ids are preserved from the source data).

on conflict (id) do nothing;
